                "loc": "EZK.45.6"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "6",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kandi ekicweka ekiritsigaraho kya mikono enkumi itaano obukiika n'oburaingwa mikono obukumi bubiri n'enkumi itaano, kiryaba eky'abantu b'obutoosha okwombekamu orurembo n'amaka n'eky'omwanya gw'akataajuure. Ahagati yaakyo haryabaho orurembo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.48.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.48.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 48:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi ezi nizo ngyero zaarwo; aha rubaju rw'aha bukiizi-bwa-bumohso ruryaba mikono enkumi ina na magana ataano; orw'aha bukiizi-bwa-buryo mikono enkumi ina na magana ataano; orw'oburugwa-izooba mikono enkumi ina na magana ataano; n'orw'oburengyerwa-izooba narwo mikono enkumi ina na magana ataano. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.48.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.48.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 48:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi orurembo ruryagira ogwo mwanya gw'akataajuure, aha rubaju rw'obukiizi-bwa-bumohso mikono magana abiri na makumi ataano, aha rw'obukiizi-bwa-buryo mikono magana abiri na makumi ataano, aha rw'oburugwa-izooba mikono magana abiri na amkumi ataano, naha buryengyerwa-izooba naho mikono magana abiri na makumi ataano. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.48.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.48.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 48:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekicweka ekiritsigaraho, ekiheereraine n'ekicweka ky'omugabo ogurikwera, kiryaba mikono kakumi aha rubaju rw'orurembo orw'oburugwa-izooba, kandi mikono kakumi aha rubaju rwarwo orw'oburengyerwa-izooba; hoona haheererane n'ekyo kicweka ekirikwera. Kandi emyaka yaaho eryaguma ebe eby'okurya by'abakozi b'omu rurembo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.48.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.48.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 48:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abakozi b'omu rurembo, abarikuruga omu nganda zoona eza Israeli, nibo bariguma nibahahinga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.48.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.48.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
