          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahaheereraine n'ekyanga kya Benyamiini okuruga oburugwa-izooba okuhika oburengyerwa-izooba guryaba omugabo gwa Simeoni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
