          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahaheereraine n'ekyanga kya Gaadi aha rubaju rw'obukiizi-bwa-buryo, omwatano guryaruga Tamari, guhikye aha maizi ga Meribati-kadeshi, gugumizemu gurabe aha rubaju rw'akagyera ka Misri, guhikye aha Nyanga empango. ",
          "type": "text",
