              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aha rubaju rw'oburugwa-izooba, orwa mikono enkumi ina na magana ataano, amarembo ashatu, erya Yosefu, erya Benyamiini, n'erya Daani; ",
          "type": "text",
